{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"BTop_n"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"BTop_n"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathsf{BTop}(n)$ 是 $n$ 维流形范畴 $\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$ 中由一个对象 $\\mathbb{R}^n$ 构成的全子范畴, 是</p>\n"}}